    "core_formula": "d_1d_2=b^2,\\quad OH_1=OH_2=a,\\quad x_Mx_N=c^2\\ (x_0y_0\\ne0),\\quad S_{\\max}=\\begin{cases}2bc,&c\\le b\\\\a^2,&c\\ge b\\end{cases}",
